  "sentences": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "text": "According to NBC, Iran's Foreign Minister Abbas Araghchi stated on September 27 that Iran is now prepared for a potential war with the US after US President Donald Trump publicly rejected Iran's proposal for the Hormuz Strait.",
      "text_file": "/home/wl26/project/media_en_news/resource/text/news_001.txt",
      "prompt_file": "/home/wl26/project/media_en_news/resource/image_prompt/news_001.txt",
      "audio_file": "/home/wl26/project/media_en_news/resource/audio/news_001.wav",
      "image_file": "/home/wl26/project/media_en_news/resource/images/news_001.png",
      "status": "ok"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "text": "However, Iran has not given up on diplomatic efforts.",
      "text_file": "/home/wl26/project/media_en_news/resource/text/news_002.txt",
      "prompt_file": "/home/wl26/project/media_en_news/resource/image_prompt/news_002.txt",
      "audio_file": "/home/wl26/project/media_en_news/resource/audio/news_002.wav",
      "image_file": "/home/wl26/project/media_en_news/resource/images/news_002.png",
      "status": "ok"
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "text": "During an interview with NBC's \"Meet the Press,\" Araghchi said, \"We are now ready for a war, but we are still trying to find a diplomatic solution.\" He emphasized that if Iran is attacked again, it will be ready to fight, \"even if it means a war of annihilation.\"",
      "text_file": "/home/wl26/project/media_en_news/resource/text/news_003.txt",
      "prompt_file": "/home/wl26/project/media_en_news/resource/image_prompt/news_003.txt",
      "audio_file": "/home/wl26/project/media_en_news/resource/audio/news_003.wav",
      "image_file": "/home/wl26/project/media_en_news/resource/images/news_003.png",
      "status": "ok"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "text": "However, Araghchi also stated that Iran is still willing to resolve the issue through diplomatic means, \"now it is up to President Trump to make the choice.\"",
      "text_file": "/home/wl26/project/media_en_news/resource/text/news_004.txt",
      "prompt_file": "/home/wl26/project/media_en_news/resource/image_prompt/news_004.txt",
      "audio_file": "/home/wl26/project/media_en_news/resource/audio/news_004.wav",
      "image_file": "/home/wl26/project/media_en_news/resource/images/news_004.png",
      "status": "ok"
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "text": "Last week, Iran submitted a proposal to the US through Qatar, suggesting reopening the Hormuz Strait within seven days to restore normal shipping in this crucial global oil transportation route.",
      "text_file": "/home/wl26/project/media_en_news/resource/text/news_005.txt",
      "prompt_file": "/home/wl26/project/media_en_news/resource/image_prompt/news_005.txt",
      "audio_file": "/home/wl26/project/media_en_news/resource/audio/news_005.wav",
      "image_file": "/home/wl26/project/media_en_news/resource/images/news_005.png",
      "status": "ok"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "text": "US President Donald Trump rejected the proposal on September 26, stating that Iran is eager to reach an agreement because they have suffered too much.",
      "text_file": "/home/wl26/project/media_en_news/resource/text/news_006.txt",
      "prompt_file": "/home/wl26/project/media_en_news/resource/image_prompt/news_006.txt",
      "audio_file": "/home/wl26/project/media_en_news/resource/audio/news_006.wav",
      "image_file": "/home/wl26/project/media_en_news/resource/images/news_006.png",
      "status": "ok"
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "text": "Araghchi clarified that Iran is not proposing new conditions, but rather conditions that the US has previously committed to, such as releasing frozen Iranian funds and assets, and allowing Iran to sell oil.",
      "text_file": "/home/wl26/project/media_en_news/resource/text/news_007.txt",
      "prompt_file": "/home/wl26/project/media_en_news/resource/image_prompt/news_007.txt",
      "audio_file": "/home/wl26/project/media_en_news/resource/audio/news_007.wav",
      "image_file": "/home/wl26/project/media_en_news/resource/images/news_007.png",
      "status": "ok"
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "text": "Regarding Trump's claim that Iran is waiting for the results of the US midterm elections, Araghchi responded, \"We do not care about the US midterm elections, we only care about our national interests.\"",
      "text_file": "/home/wl26/project/media_en_news/resource/text/news_008.txt",
      "prompt_file": "/home/wl26/project/media_en_news/resource/image_prompt/news_008.txt",
      "audio_file": "/home/wl26/project/media_en_news/resource/audio/news_008.wav",
      "image_file": "/home/wl26/project/media_en_news/resource/images/news_008.png",
      "status": "ok"
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "text": "On September 27, according to the Iranian Mehr News Agency, Iran's Foreign Minister Abbas Araghchi stated that Iran is now prepared for a potential war with the US, but has not given up on diplomatic efforts.",
      "text_file": "/home/wl26/project/media_en_news/resource/text/news_009.txt",
      "prompt_file": "/home/wl26/project/media_en_news/resource/image_prompt/news_009.txt",
      "audio_file": "/home/wl26/project/media_en_news/resource/audio/news_009.wav",
      "image_file": "/home/wl26/project/media_en_news/resource/images/news_009.png",
      "status": "ok"
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "text": "Araghchi, speaking at a UN General Assembly press conference on September 27, said, \"We are now ready for a war, but we are still trying to find a diplomatic solution.",
      "text_file": "/home/wl26/project/media_en_news/resource/text/news_010.txt",
      "prompt_file": "/home/wl26/project/media_en_news/resource/image_prompt/news_010.txt",
      "audio_file": "/home/wl26/project/media_en_news/resource/audio/news_010.wav",
      "image_file": "/home/wl26/project/media_en_news/resource/images/news_010.png",
      "status": "ok"
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "text": "We do not have a reason to return to diplomacy, but we are still trying to find a diplomatic solution because we believe we should not miss any opportunities for peace.\"",
      "text_file": "/home/wl26/project/media_en_news/resource/text/news_011.txt",
      "prompt_file": "/home/wl26/project/media_en_news/resource/image_prompt/news_011.txt",
      "audio_file": "/home/wl26/project/media_en_news/resource/audio/news_011.wav",
      "image_file": "/home/wl26/project/media_en_news/resource/images/news_011.png",
      "status": "ok"
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "text": "He emphasized that Iran is willing to negotiate and is ready to face any challenges, \"even if the conflict escalates to a war of annihilation, we will be resolute in resisting aggression.\"",
      "text_file": "/home/wl26/project/media_en_news/resource/text/news_012.txt",
      "prompt_file": "/home/wl26/project/media_en_news/resource/image_prompt/news_012.txt",
      "audio_file": "/home/wl26/project/media_en_news/resource/audio/news_012.wav",
      "image_file": "/home/wl26/project/media_en_news/resource/images/news_012.png",
      "status": "ok"
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "text": "On September 25, the Revolutionary Guard claimed to have detained a US Navy unmanned underwater vehicle (UUV) in the Hormuz Strait.",
      "text_file": "/home/wl26/project/media_en_news/resource/text/news_013.txt",
      "prompt_file": "/home/wl26/project/media_en_news/resource/image_prompt/news_013.txt",
      "audio_file": "/home/wl26/project/media_en_news/resource/audio/news_013.wav",
      "image_file": "/home/wl26/project/media_en_news/resource/images/news_013.png",
      "status": "ok"
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "text": "According to the Tasnim News Agency, the vehicle was identified as a Remus 600 and has been handed over to experts for data extraction.",
      "text_file": "/home/wl26/project/media_en_news/resource/text/news_014.txt",
      "prompt_file": "/home/wl26/project/media_en_news/resource/image_prompt/news_014.txt",
