      "status": "ok"
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "text": "The US Navy did not immediately respond to a request for comment.",
      "text_file": "/home/wl26/project/media_en_news/resource/text/news_015.txt",
      "prompt_file": "/home/wl26/project/media_en_news/resource/image_prompt/news_015.txt",
      "audio_file": "/home/wl26/project/media_en_news/resource/audio/news_015.wav",
      "image_file": "/home/wl26/project/media_en_news/resource/images/news_015.png",
      "status": "ok"
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "text": "Previously, Araghchi announced on September 25 at the UN headquarters in New York that Iran had submitted a proposal to the US through Qatar, suggesting reopening the Hormuz Strait within seven days to restore normal shipping.",
      "text_file": "/home/wl26/project/media_en_news/resource/text/news_016.txt",
      "prompt_file": "/home/wl26/project/media_en_news/resource/image_prompt/news_016.txt",
      "audio_file": "/home/wl26/project/media_en_news/resource/audio/news_016.wav",
      "image_file": "/home/wl26/project/media_en_news/resource/images/news_016.png",
      "status": "ok"
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "text": "However, The Wall Street Journal reported on September 25 that Trump rejected Iran's proposal and told his aides that he may resume bombing Iran after the US midterm elections in November.",
      "text_file": "/home/wl26/project/media_en_news/resource/text/news_017.txt",
      "prompt_file": "/home/wl26/project/media_en_news/resource/image_prompt/news_017.txt",
      "audio_file": "/home/wl26/project/media_en_news/resource/audio/news_017.wav",
      "image_file": "/home/wl26/project/media_en_news/resource/images/news_017.png",
      "status": "ok"
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "text": "Araghchi clarified that the mediation party has not yet conveyed the US's formal rejection to Tehran.",
      "text_file": "/home/wl26/project/media_en_news/resource/text/news_018.txt",
      "prompt_file": "/home/wl26/project/media_en_news/resource/image_prompt/news_018.txt",
      "audio_file": "/home/wl26/project/media_en_news/resource/audio/news_018.wav",
      "image_file": "/home/wl26/project/media_en_news/resource/images/news_018.png",
      "status": "ok"
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
